01:10:16.745 --> 01:10:18.804
What a lovely suit.


01:10:23.385 --> 01:10:24.477
Move it.


01:10:24.653 --> 01:10:27.053
Hey. Out of the way. Out of the way.
Michael, go on.


01:10:27.222 --> 01:10:29.486
