I'll see you at the end.


01:10:29.658 --> 01:10:31.523
Guy. Tom. Tom.


01:10:32.160 --> 01:10:33.559
I'll be right back.


01:10:36.097 --> 01:10:37.359
Good to see you.


01:10:37.532 --> 01:10:39.397
Nice suit.


01:10:46.241 --> 01:10:50.177
What was that back there?
This is your last chance to get it right.


01:10:50.345 --> 01:10:53.314
Unless you wanna see
Angela's Juilliard dreams go bye-bye.


01:10:53.481 --> 01:10:57.440
That what you wanna be? A little
dwarfish Asian girl's dream crusher, huh?


01:10:57.619 --> 01:10:58.643
- Do you?
- No. No.


01:10:58.820 --> 01:11:01.687
No? No? No? Then focus!


01:11:07.195 --> 01:11:09.857
- Look, Ange, you...
- Gail's been threatening me too.


01:11:10.031 --> 01:11:12.056
That's why you're doing
what she wants.


01:11:12.400 --> 01:11:14.698
