- Ange.


01:11:15.303 --> 01:11:17.237
You're my best friend.


01:11:17.405 --> 01:11:19.839
Look, I'd do anything for you.


01:11:30.318 --> 01:11:32.149
Okay.


01:11:34.389 --> 01:11:38.917
So we're gonna take it up a notch
with Jason Berkeley and the Funky Funk.


01:11:44.766 --> 01:11:45.790
Scratch that.


01:11:45.967 --> 01:11:48.902
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:57.612 --> 01:12:00.080
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:12:00.248 --> 01:12:04.150
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:06.955 --> 01:12:08.320
Move it. Guy.


01:12:08.490 --> 01:12:12.688
This is just the boring appetizer.
The real showstopper's up next.


01:12:12.861 --> 01:12:14.328
Ah!
Oh!


01:12:14.496 --> 01:12:17.363
You okay, Mr. Morgan?
Here, let me get that for you.


01:12:18.800 --> 01:12:19.994
Well, it had better be.


01:12:20.168 --> 01:12:21.396
I have to pee.


01:12:21.569 --> 01:12:24.800
Oh, I will take you to the pee, Mr. Victor.


01:12:27.742 --> 01:12:29.573
Sorry.


01:12:30.011 --> 01:12:32.536
<i>So keep on knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


01:12:32.714 --> 01:12:37.651
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


01:12:38.386 --> 01:12:40.547
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:40.722 --> 01:12:43.782
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:43.958 --> 01:12:46.324
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:46.494 --> 01:12:49.827
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:54.636 --> 01:12:55.967
My brothers, yeah!


01:12:56.137 --> 01:12:57.536
Okay.


01:12:57.872 --> 01:13:00.033
You guys having a good time?


01:13:00.608 --> 01:13:05.011
Let's keep it going
with Beverly Van Ravensway.


01:13:17.125 --> 01:13:19.355
<i>Plug in the mike</i>


01:13:19.527 --> 01:13:20.824
<i>Open the curtain</i>


01:13:20.995 --> 01:13:22.360
<i>Turn on the lights</i>


01:13:23.164 --> 01:13:24.597
<i>I'm through rehearsing</i>


01:13:24.766 --> 01:13:26.859
<i>The feeling ignites</i>


01:13:27.035 --> 01:13:28.093
<i>I'm in control</i>


01:13:28.269 --> 01:13:32.365
<i>The crowd's in the palm of my hand
All my fans stand</i>


01:13:32.540 --> 01:13:35.976
<i>What is the truth?
What's an illusion?</i>


01:13:36.144 --> 01:13:39.841
<i>You're searching for proof
But are you certain?</i>


01:13:40.014 --> 01:13:43.575
<i>Whatever you see is what you get</i>


01:13:43.752 --> 01:13:47.552
<i>If words paint a picture
Then I bet you I can get you, yeah</i>


01:13:47.722 --> 01:13:51.954
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:13:52.127 --> 01:13:55.358
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:13:55.530 --> 01:13:58.966
<i>Tonight is the night
Where I'll make you see</i>


01:13:59.134 --> 01:14:02.831
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:14:03.004 --> 01:14:07.407
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:14:07.575 --> 01:14:09.042
<i>I can be what you want...</i>


01:14:12.914 --> 01:14:13.938
Give me...


01:14:20.622 --> 01:14:24.718
I'm so sorry, my mike...
My mike isn't working.


01:14:25.126 --> 01:14:27.617
Uh, excuse me.


01:14:30.498 --> 01:14:32.625
<i>I don't know.
- Give me that. Give me that.</i>


01:14:37.839 --> 01:14:42.071
How dare you sabotage your mother,
you rotten, rotten little boy?


01:14:42.243 --> 01:14:44.803
You, give me that. It doesn't matter.


01:14:44.979 --> 01:14:47.675
