01:14:59.928 --> 01:15:01.555
Stay.


01:15:06.034 --> 01:15:07.831
No, no, no. You gotta get out of here.


01:15:08.236 --> 01:15:11.535
You're about to sing for Bev.
Why are you about to sing for Bev?


01:15:12.474 --> 01:15:13.498
She can't sing.


01:15:19.948 --> 01:15:21.210
Come on.


01:15:21.382 --> 01:15:23.282
Hey. All of you, keep playing.


01:15:23.952 --> 01:15:25.749
Keep playing, you idiots.


01:15:25.920 --> 01:15:28.218
It was your voice the whole time?
Bev never sang at all?


01:15:29.824 --> 01:15:33.191
And she's about to not sing
for a whole bunch of people, so please...


01:15:33.361 --> 01:15:36.558
And on the dates, that... That was you.


01:15:41.002 --> 01:15:43.129
<i>I got nothing to lose</i>


01:15:43.638 --> 01:15:45.003
<i>I've been exposed</i>


01:15:45.173 --> 01:15:47.300
<i>I'm paying my dues</i>


01:15:47.475 --> 01:15:48.635
<i>Playing the role</i>


01:15:48.810 --> 01:15:51.176
<i>I'm breaking the rules</i>


01:15:51.346 --> 01:15:52.540
<i>Flow in the flow</i>


01:15:52.714 --> 01:15:56.673
<i>I got the whole world nodding, yes
Like some bobbleheads</i>


01:15:56.851 --> 01:15:58.216
<i>I'll break a sweat</i>


01:15:59.420 --> 01:16:00.444
<i>If you want it</i>


01:16:00.622 --> 01:16:02.749
<i>Confess all your sins</i>


01:16:02.924 --> 01:16:04.221
<i>You know you got 'em</i>


01:16:04.392 --> 01:16:06.656
<i>The room's in a spin</i>


01:16:06.828 --> 01:16:07.852
<i>The fever's pitched</i>


01:16:08.029 --> 01:16:09.997
- You gotta go. Come on, get out there.
Aah!


01:16:10.164 --> 01:16:11.961
<i>I'm legit, I'm no counterfeit</i>


01:16:12.133 --> 01:16:16.593
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:16.771 --> 01:16:19.535
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:19.707 --> 01:16:23.370
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:23.545 --> 01:16:27.174
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:27.348 --> 01:16:31.751
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:31.920 --> 01:16:33.114
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:33.288 --> 01:16:36.086
Hey! Shut that camera down! Now!


01:16:36.257 --> 01:16:38.725
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:38.893 --> 01:16:42.795
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:42.964 --> 01:16:45.057
<i>You want from me</i>


01:16:51.506 --> 01:16:53.303
That's what I'm talking about.


01:16:55.143 --> 01:16:57.634
Shut the power down. Shut it down.


01:17:00.782 --> 01:17:03.182
Not so fast, jerknuts.


01:17:06.487 --> 01:17:07.852
Hey. Clear.


01:17:10.959 --> 01:17:13.359
<i>Sing something else.
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:13.528 --> 01:17:14.825
Like what?


01:17:15.096 --> 01:17:16.961
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:17.131 --> 01:17:18.928
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:19.100 --> 01:17:24.470
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:27.241 --> 01:17:29.209
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:36.918 --> 01:17:40.911
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:44.025 --> 01:17:48.655
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:49.897 --> 01:17:53.458
<i>And they'll try and they'll try
To convince you to buy</i>


01:17:53.635 --> 01:17:55.125
<i>You need them</i>


01:17:57.105 --> 01:18:00.541
<i>So the next time you're down
Look inside, not around</i>


01:18:00.708 --> 01:18:03.871
<i>I can dress myself</i>


01:18:04.045 --> 01:18:06.980
<i>There's no need for someone's help</i>


01:18:07.148 --> 01:18:08.775
<i>There's no one to blame</i>


01:18:08.950 --> 01:18:14.684
<i>There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:18:14.856 --> 01:18:18.155
<i>I can justify</i>


01:18:18.326 --> 01:18:21.295
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:18:21.462 --> 01:18:24.659
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:24.832 --> 01:18:27.232
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:27.402 --> 01:18:30.530
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:32.006 --> 01:18:38.878
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:39.047 --> 01:18:42.710
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:42.884 --> 01:18:49.881
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:50.058 --> 01:18:53.323
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:53.494 --> 01:18:56.395
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:56.564 --> 01:19:03.993
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:19:04.172 --> 01:19:07.369
<i>I can justify</i>


01:19:07.542 --> 01:19:10.511
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:10.678 --> 01:19:13.772
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:13.948 --> 01:19:16.439
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:16.617 --> 01:19:19.347
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:36.871 --> 01:19:38.532
Thank you, ladies and gentlemen.


01:19:38.706 --> 01:19:42.107
We hope you enjoyed the Wellesley
Academy of Arts Showcase.


01:19:42.276 --> 01:19:44.836
Oh, my God, you were so good.


01:19:45.213 --> 01:19:47.545
Who are you?
You're like a freaking rock star.


01:19:47.715 --> 01:19:49.808
Are you kidding me? Man, she likes you...


01:20:01.028 --> 01:20:03.963
So, what did he say? Is he mad?


01:20:04.132 --> 01:20:05.793
Yeah. He's pretty ticked off...


01:20:05.967 --> 01:20:09.733
...that I'm not already making
the next big album for Kensington Records.


01:20:11.706 --> 01:20:13.469
Oh. Which album?


01:20:14.375 --> 01:20:15.399
Your album.


01:20:17.078 --> 01:20:19.069
- Are you kidding me?
- No.


01:20:20.681 --> 01:20:23.149
- You're... You're serious?
- Uh-huh.


01:20:25.386 --> 01:20:26.717
Go for it.


01:20:26.888 --> 01:20:29.652
We're making an album.
And we're writing it together.


01:20:29.824 --> 01:20:31.883
Yeah! Yeah!
I'm so happy.


01:20:32.059 --> 01:20:33.856
You know, I sing too.


01:20:34.028 --> 01:20:37.657
I can do a whole monologue album.
Incredible. Hey, congratulations.


01:20:37.832 --> 01:20:42.360
- Yo, blow it up. Boom.
I'm your boy. Call me up.


01:20:42.537 --> 01:20:45.938
Yeah. Yeah, he's really good
at guitars. He's a kook.


01:21:00.655 --> 01:21:02.247
Guy! Wait!


01:21:02.423 --> 01:21:05.915
