- Well, everyone lies in this business.


01:21:06.093 --> 01:21:07.117
It's called spin.


01:21:07.762 --> 01:21:09.127
So Bev can't sing.


01:21:09.297 --> 01:21:11.026
That didn't stop Jessica Simpson.


01:21:11.199 --> 01:21:14.794
Well, we'll see what the school board
thinks when I get them a ring, shall we?


01:21:15.169 --> 01:21:17.967
