Guy!


01:21:25.079 --> 01:21:28.742
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:28.983 --> 01:21:32.749
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:34.222 --> 01:21:37.282
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:37.458 --> 01:21:40.052
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:40.228 --> 01:21:41.786
Let's try this again.


01:21:41.996 --> 01:21:43.861
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:45.433 --> 01:21:48.163
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:13.828 --> 01:22:16.058
Hey. Clear.


01:22:31.746 --> 01:22:33.907
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:34.081 --> 01:22:36.447
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:18.326 --> 01:23:20.920
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:21.095 --> 01:23:23.962
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:28.936 --> 01:23:32.463
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:38.913 --> 01:23:40.972
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:46.153 --> 01:23:50.453
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:54.895 --> 01:23:57.887
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:58.065 --> 01:24:00.192
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:19.687 --> 01:24:21.552
I love my life.


01:24:21.722 --> 01:24:23.917
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:46.380 --> 01:24:49.577
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

